{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50723","headline":"所居即事六首（原注：丹阳闲居寄郑明府如范上人。） 其六 · 张祜","name":"所居即事六首（原注：丹阳闲居寄郑明府如范上人。） 其六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨起常掻两鬓丝，小亭深坐一洿池。\n墙头鸜鹆隈花叶，水面蜻蜓寄草枝。\n赖得木奴些子力，生憎鱼婢苦顽痴。\n扁舟远棹寻春处，竹榼新醪喜自随。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50723.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50723","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}